msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Excuse me... Do you know if there's a bar called Jinsei\r\n"
"somewhere around here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Jinsei? Oh, yeah, yeah... I remember that place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"It was right across from us, but it was torn down ages ago.\r\n"
"There's another building there now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"I see... Well, do you know if it moved somewhere else or did\r\n"
"it just close down for good?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Good question. This was back when all that land speculation\r\n"
"stuff was going on. Rumor has it they needed a tidy sum to\r\n"
"keep the land sharks at bay⑬and I ain't talkin' mutant fish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Oh, that's right! Now I remember. I heard it got moved over\r\n"
"to the <Color:7>Champion District<Color:Default>. Yeeeahhh, that sounds "
"about right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"The Champion District it is, then. Thanks. You've been a big\r\n"
"help."
msgstr ""

